04fbfaef1818a608f3361d24f0\",\"algorithm_version\":\"dagbt_residual_memory_v2\",\"program_identity\":\"3f4f75db12138a787ef07044d4575ec6e44520ec62365409ce5acc43fb175d13\",\"initial_dag_identity\":\"6dd4ec4970718d597e8245d1c4e2cf987ac0e71a256255f436d17b8c298945db\"},\"variables\":{\"creative_history\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"demand\":\"creative_history\",\"open\":true,\"evidence_semantics\":\"personal_history_summary\",\"scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"}}},\"requested_slots\":[\"creative_history\"],\"requested_scopes\":{\"creative_history\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"}},\"output_contract\":{\"mode\":\"semantic\",\"result_type\":\"text\",\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\",\"explanation\":\"semantic\"},\"program_revision\":0,\"rule_binding\":null,\"supported_parents\":{},\"known_observations\":[{\"id\":\"fact_3aa01bff7eaf8a96cd69845c\",\"stance\":\"support\",\"value\":\"The user has a history of creative engagement with music, including digital remixing in 2010, which they found exciting and creatively fulfilling. They later announced a hiatus from remixing to focus on original compositions and personal projects, aiming to develop their unique artistic voice. They also explored historical music trends in 2020 but found it tedious and uninspiring, preferring less structured exploration. They have expressed interest in attending live performances, discovering album artwork and lyrics, and creating themed playlists. They have also considered audio production but have not confirmed pursuing it. They have a general desire for deeper, personal engagement with music rather than passive consumption.\",\"source_ids\":[\"s15\",\"s28\",\"s45\",\"s7\",\"s4\",\"s16\",\"s5\",\"s19\",\"s36\",\"s44\",\"s18\",\"s35\",\"s3\",\"s27\",\"s6\",\"s17\"],\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\",\"parent_versions\":{},\"retract_ids\":[],\"reason\":\"The user explicitly describes past creative activities: digital remixing in 2010 (s27, s28), a hiatus from remixing to focus on original compositions (s3–s7), trying historical music trends in 2020 (s15–s17), and engaging with music through live performances, album artwork, lyrics, and playlists (s18, s19). They also reflect on a documentary that left them unsatisfied, reinforcing a preference for personal creation over passive consumption (s35, s36). They lost interest in music theory due to it becoming a chore (s44, s45). These sources collectively support a comprehensive summary of the user's past creative hobbies and interests.\",\"variable\":\"creative_history\",\"revoked\":[],\"semantic_status\":\"model_judgment\",\"superseded_by\":[\"fact_53791a3bdce267b95df08adc\"]},{\"id\":\"fact_53791a3bdce267b95df08adc\",\"stance\":\"support\",\"value\":\"The user has a history of creative engagement with music, including digital remixing in 2010, which they found exciting and creatively fulfilling. They later announced a hiatus from remixing to focus on original compositions and personal projects, aiming to develop their unique artistic voice. They also explored historical music trends in 2020 but found it tedious and uninspiring, preferring less structured exploration. They have expressed interest in attending live performances, discovering album artwork and lyrics, and creating themed playlists. They have also considered audio production but have not confirmed pursuing it. They have a general desire for deeper, personal engagement with music rather than passive consumption. Additionally, the user launched a podcast discussing the fusion of traditional and electronic music, which has allowed them to reach a wider audience and share experiences authentically. They enrolled in an audio production workshop after attending a hands-on workshop on integrating traditional sounds with digital techniques, and found the practical aspects exciting. They also recorded field sounds of nature to blend with their music, which rejuvenated their passion for creating. They have expressed a focus on what truly inspires them, such as creating their own tracks, which brings them joy and satisfaction. They have also reflected that audio production techniques did not resonate with them, feeling tangled in technical details, and prefer the emotional aspects of music.\",\"source_ids\":[\"s15\",\"s111\",\"s112\",\"s28\",\"s45\",\"s64\",\"s52\",\"s90\",\"s61\",\"s7\",\"s88\",\"s4\",\"s99\",\"s16\",\"s5\",\"s19\",\"s36\",\"s44\",\"s53\",\"s89\",\"s18\",\"s63\",\"s35\",\"s51\",\"s54\",\"s102\",\"s3\",\"s100\",\"s101\",\"s27\",\"s98\",\"s62\",\"s6\",\"s110\",\"s17\"],\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\",\"parent_versions\":{},\"retract_ids\":[],\"summary_revision\":{\"supersedes_route_ids\":[\"fact_3aa01bff7eaf8a96cd69845c\"],\"previous_version\":1,\"reason\":\"Incorporates additional compatible historical evidence from new sources (podcast launch, audio production workshop enrollment, field recording, and further reflections on creative focus) while retaining all original supported facts and their sources.\"},\"reason\":\"The user explicitly describes past creative activities: digital remixing in 2010 (s27, s28), a hiatus from remixing to focus on original compositions (s3–s7), trying historical music trends in 2020 (s15–s17), engaging with music through live performances, album artwork, lyrics, and playlists (s18, s19), reflecting on a documentary that left them unsatisfied (s35, s36), losing interest in music theory (s44, s45), launching a podcast on traditional and electronic music fusion (s51–s54), enrolling in an audio production workshop after a hands-on workshop (s61–s64), recording field sounds of nature (s110–s112), focusing on what truly inspires them (s88–s90), and finding audio production techniques unfulfilling while preferring emotional aspects of music (s98–s102). These sources collectively support a comprehensive summary of the user's past creative hobbies and interests.\",\"variable\":\"creative_history\",\"revoked\":[],\"semantic_status\":\"model_judgment\"}],\"source_spans\":[[\"s3\",\"d1\",107,413,\"User: I announced a hiatus from remixing to concentrate on original compositions and personal projects because I felt the remixes were overshadowing my own work. This decision was not made lightly, as I enjoyed the creative process of remixing and the way it allowed me to experiment with existing pieces. \",\"user\",[128,129]],[\"s4\",\"d1\",413,797,\"However, as I delved deeper into my own musical identity, I realized that I need to carve out space for my voice to shine through in original compositions. Taking this time off is about redefining my artistic vision and ensuring that my personal projects receive the attention they deserve. Ultimately, I hope to return with fresh ideas and a clearer focus on who I am as an artist.\\n\\n\",\"user\",[128,129]],[\"s5\",\"d1\",797,1102,\"User: I'm committing to invest my time in the creation of original music, focusing on my unique sound rather than merely reinterpreting the pieces of other artists. This decision comes from a deep-rooted desire to express my thoughts and feelings in ways that truly resonate with my personal experiences. \",\"user\",[128,129]],[\"s6\",\"d1\",1102,1392,\"I've come to understand that original compositions allow for a more authentic exploration of my artistic vision. It's an exciting challenge for me, as I embark on this journey of self-discovery through sound and melody, ultimately aiming for a sense of fulfillment in my creative pursuits. \",\"user\",[128,129]],[\"s7\",\"d1\",1392,1515,\"I hope to not only develop my skills but also share my passion with the world in a way that reflects who I am as an artist.\",\"user\",[128,129]],[\"s15\",\"d2\",105,393,\"User: It was something I tried in 2020, but researching historical music trends felt tedious and uninspiring. Despite my initial enthusiasm, diving into the vast amounts of literature, videos, and academic papers often felt overwhelming, almost like searching for a needle in a haystack. \",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s16\",\"d2\",393,638,\"The more I tried to pinpoint what fascinated me, the more daunting it became, complicating the pursuit of enjoyable learning. Perhaps due to this overload of information, I lost sight of what initially drew me to the subject in the first place. \",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s17\",\"d2\",638,828,\"It made me realize that sometimes a less structured approach to exploration could be more fulfilling, allowing for genuine interest to emerge rather than adhering strictly to a curriculum.\\n\\n\",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s18\",\"d2\",828,1224,\"User: I realized that there are so many other ways for me to engage with music that align more with my interests, such as diving deeper into different genres or exploring the cultural significance behind various musical styles. Additionally, I've found that attending live performances, whether they are concerts or smaller gigs, allows me to truly feel the energy and connection with the music. \",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s19\",\"d2\",1224,1624,\"Moreover, there's something special about discovering album artwork, lyrics, and the stories behind the songs that really captivates my curiosity. I've also considered making playlists that reflect different moods or themes, which can create a unique listening experience each time. The journey through music feels more personal and fulfilling when I can connect it to my own life story and emotions.\",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s27\",\"d3\",103,370,\"User: That was back in 2010. I remember feeling really excited about the whole process. It was such a wave of creativity! I still think about those late nights spent tweaking sounds and layering beats, capturing the essence of what I wanted to express through music. \",\"user\",[3]],[\"s28\",\"d3\",370,611,\"The thrill of sharing those creations with others is something I cherish deeply, as it fostered a sense of community among my friends. Looking back, it feels like a pivotal moment that sparked my passion for music production and digital art.\",\"user\",[3]],[\"s35\",\"d4\",105,478,\"User: I left feeling unsatisfied, as though the film skimmed over the intricacies that make music a universal language. It was almost as if they focused too much on celebrity interviews and not enough on the artistic process itself. I found myself reflecting on how music has the power to unite diverse cultures and express emotions that words alone often fail to capture. \",\"user\",[43]],[\"s36\",\"d4\",478,845,\"The disappointment lingered as I thought about the many documentaries that delve into the creative journeys of musicians, revealing not just their triumphs but also their struggles and failures. It made me realize that true connection with music often comes from a deeper engagement, one that can be achieved through personal creation rather than passive consumption.\",\"user\",[43]],[\"s44\",\"d5\",105,482,\"User: I just lost interest halfway through and felt it was taking away the joy I find in music. There was a time when the thrill of discovering new melodies brought so much happiness, but diving too deep into the technical aspects became more of a chore. It’s curious how something that once brought joy can evolve into a source of stress when we start dissecting it too much. \",\"user\",[24]],[\"s45\",\"d5\",482,767,\"I remember the initial excitement of exploring different genres, each bringing a fresh perspective, but I struggled with the framework of music theory. Ultimately, I recognized that the essence of my love for music lay in its emotional connection rather than its analytical components.\",\"user\",[24]],[\"s51\",\"d6\",105,447,\"User: Yes! I launched a podcast discussing the fusion of traditional and electronic music. This platform has allowed me to reach a wider audience and share my experiences authentically. By interviewing artists and enthusiasts, I can dive deep into their creative processes and discover how they incorporate various elements into their music. \",\"user\",[58,59]],[\"s52\",\"d6\",447,817,\"The feedback I’ve received has been overwhelmingly positive, with listeners appreciating the insights and stories shared. I also love being able to explore not just the music itself, but the cultural contexts that shape these genres and influence artists worldwide.\\n\\nUser: I realized that sharing my experiences could inspire others and even reignite my own creativity. \",\"user\",[58,59]],[\"s53\",\"d6\",817,1128,\"The process of putting my thoughts into words has helped clarify my own perspective. It’s surprising how reflecting on past experiences can lead to deeper insights about one’s journey. Additionally, I’ve noticed that when I articulate my thoughts, it motivates me to think critically about my creative process. \",\"user\",[58,59]],[\"s54\",\"d6\",1128,1266,\"This paradigm shift has not only invigorated my passion for music but also allowed me to connect with others who share similar sentiments.\",\"user\",[58,59]],[\"s61\",\"d7\",105,388,\"User: Absolutely! After attending a hands-on workshop focused on integrating traditional sounds with digital techniques, I’m now enrolled in an audio production workshop. The workshop was eye-opening, providing insights into how to use technology to enhance traditional music forms. \",\"user\",[70,71]],[\"s62\",\"d7\",388,780,\"I’m excited about the audio production course because it promises to deepen my technical knowledge and skills, especially in mixing and mastering. This new set of skills will allow me to bring my creative vision to life in ways I never thought possible. I truly believe that this journey will not only elevate my music but also connect me more deeply with the traditions I'm learning about.\\n\\n\",\"user\",[70,71]],[\"s63\",\"d7\",780,1127,\"User: I found the practical aspects very exciting and relevant to my projects. Engaging in hands-on activities allows me to not only enhance my skills but also gain the confidence to experiment with different methods. It's invigorating to immerse myself in a learning environment where I can translate my imaginative ideas into tangible outcomes. \",\"user\",[70,71]],[\"s64\",\"d7\",1127,1386,\"This experience feels entirely different from the theoretical coursework, as it truly brings the subject to life. I believe this grounding in practical techniques will significantly impact my overall creative journey and foster a deeper connection to my work.\",\"user\",[70,71]],[\"s88\",\"d8\",107,341,\"User: It’s become clear to me that I need to focus on what truly inspires me and aligns more with my interests, especially recognizing how vital it is to engage with topics and activities that evoke a sense of passion and enthusiasm. \",\"user\",[107]],[\"s89\",\"d8\",341,694,\"I have realized that my time and energy are precious commodities, and they should be spent on pursuits that not only enrich my knowledge but also bring me a profound sense of fulfillment. Diving deeper into interests that resonate with my core values feels necessary, rather than stretching myself thin over activities that don't spark joy or interest. \",\"user\",[107]],[\"s90\",\"d8\",694,951,\"This realization is quite liberating, as I can see a path ahead that is clearer and more authentic to who I truly am. It makes me think about how we all deserve to chase our passions instead of conforming to what society or external pressures might dictate.\",\"user\",[107]],[\"s98\",\"d9\",105,430,\"User: I explored audio production techniques, but it just didn’t resonate with me, and I found myself tangled in technical details rather than embracing the creativity. I realized that while understanding the mechanics of sound is important, my true passion seems to lie more in experiencing music rather than dissecting it. \",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s99\",\"d9\",430,749,\"Despite my attempts to immerse myself in the production process, I came to feel it was more of a chore and less of the rewarding experience I had initially anticipated. I think I am more drawn to the emotional aspects of music, like the storytelling elements in lyrics or the feelings evoked by melodies and harmonies. \",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s100\",\"d9\",749,1006,\"Perhaps, I should focus my energy on areas that allow me to connect with music on a more emotional level.\\n\\nUser: It genuinely feels much better to focus on what truly inspires me, such as creating my own tracks, which bring me immense joy and satisfaction. \",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s101\",\"d9\",1006,1339,\"This process of creation allows me to express emotions and ideas that words sometimes fail to capture, acting as an outlet for my inner thoughts and feelings. Additionally, I find that crafting my own music provides me with a sense of accomplishment and personal growth, which is invaluable in a world often filled with uncertainty. \",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s102\",\"d9\",1339,1686,\"Music has a way of resonating with my soul, and every track I create becomes a piece of my identity and a reflection of my experiences. In contrast, when I watched a music documentary, it felt like something was missing, as it didn’t engage me in the way I had hoped, failing to evoke that same deep connection I feel when I compose my own pieces.\",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s110\",\"d10\",105,344,\"User: It was a great way to blend my love for the outdoors with my musical creativity. The sounds of nature really added depth to the track, creating a rich tapestry of auditory experiences that transported listeners to serene landscapes. \",\"user\",[81]],[\"s111\",\"d10\",344,695,\"Moments spent in the woods, by riversides, or during rainy afternoons provided the perfect backdrop for inspiration, as I captured the essence of what it feels like to be in those environments. Each recording not only served as an instrument but also as a reminder of the memories tied to those places, enriching the emotional resonance of the music. \",\"user\",[81]],[\"s112\",\"d10\",695,817,\"This blending of natural elements with melody has truly rejuvenated my passion for creating and sharing music with others.\",\"user\",[81]],[\"s113\",\"d10\",817,830,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s114\",\"d10\",830,1178,\"Assistant: That sounds beautiful! Nature can inspire such unique musical elements, providing textures and layers that are often hard to replicate with traditional instruments alone. It’s fascinating how something as simple as the rustling of leaves or the chirping of birds can evoke powerful emotions and influence the direction of a composition. \",\"assistant\",[82]],[\"s115\",\"d10\",1178,1415,\"Have you thought about collaborating with other musicians on this? Working with others who share your passion for blending genres can lead to remarkable synergies, where each artist’s strengths complement one another in unexpected ways. \",\"assistant\",[82]],[\"s116\",\"d10\",1415,1777,\"Collaborations can also introduce you to new techniques, sounds, and ideas that could elevate your projects even further, especially in a band setting where different styles can creatively clash and harmonize. Plus, sharing your musical journey with others can lead to a richer experience, as you exchange not just sounds but stories behind every note and beat. \",\"assistant\",[82]],[\"s117\",\"d10\",1777,1897,\"I would love to learn more about your experiences in these collaborations and how they impact your music-making process.\",\"assistant\",[82]]],\"required_scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"},\"rules_completion_required\":false,\"supported_task_outputs\":{},\"personal_response_selection\":true,\"phase\":\"history_evidence\",\"summary_revision_contracts\":{\"creative_history\":{\"previous_version\":2,\"eligible_route_ids\":[\"fact_53791a3bdce267b95df08adc\"],\"required_source_ids\":[\"s15\",\"s111\",\"s112\",\"s28\",\"s45\",\"s64\",\"s52\",\"s90\",\"s61\",\"s7\",\"s88\",\"s4\",\"s99\",\"s16\",\"s5\",\"s19\",\"s36