llment. Diving deeper into interests that resonate with my core values feels necessary, rather than stretching myself thin over activities that don't spark joy or interest. \",\"user\",[107]],[\"s90\",\"d5\",694,951,\"This realization is quite liberating, as I can see a path ahead that is clearer and more authentic to who I truly am. It makes me think about how we all deserve to chase our passions instead of conforming to what society or external pressures might dictate.\",\"user\",[107]],[\"s91\",\"d5\",951,964,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s92\",\"d5\",964,1189,\"Assistant: It's truly commendable that you've taken this step back to reassess your priorities and focus on your authentic interests, as this kind of self-reflection is often the catalyst for meaningful change in one's life. \",\"assistant\",[108]]],\"required_scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"},\"rules_completion_required\":false,\"supported_task_outputs\":{},\"personal_response_selection\":true,\"phase\":\"history_evidence\",\"source_documents\":{\"d1\":{\"doc_id\":\"personamem:memory:dec3472e053d202dcd3cd3a9ab730cba91ae9b38d5a120db5c35075af3276352\",\"time_metadata\":{\"observed_start\":128.0,\"observed_end\":130.0,\"event_start\":null,\"event_end\":null,\"validity\":\"unknown\",\"time_source\":\"message_index\"}},\"d2\":{\"doc_id\":\"personamem:memory:7b3d5b8ebc55d4f8463449dd3b6b3147d9d452c1784c214e31094e837a45ed88\",\"time_metadata\":{\"observed_start\":43.0,\"observed_end\":44.0,\"event_start\":null,\"event_end\":null,\"validity\":\"unknown\",\"time_source\":\"message_index\"}},\"d3\":{\"doc_id\":\"personamem:memory:fb92ef0e1a4225760df5a3c1f2e08bd15c308df214b1deb25d9edb46d1c08214\",\"time_metadata\":{\"observed_start\":58.0,\"observed_end\":60.0,\"event_start\":null,\"event_end\":null,\"validity\":\"unknown\",\"time_source\":\"message_index\"}},\"d4\":{\"doc_id\":\"personamem:memory:d89f3ce0a5eceae0fe8e1557cbc17cb1fcc8d9189296415dbdc0a4060d0c8d23\",\"time_metadat