ffff84dacbcbf8cc52f5d9d53\",\"algorithm_version\":\"dagbt_residual_memory_v2\",\"program_identity\":\"3f4f75db12138a787ef07044d4575ec6e44520ec62365409ce5acc43fb175d13\",\"initial_dag_identity\":\"6dd4ec4970718d597e8245d1c4e2cf987ac0e71a256255f436d17b8c298945db\"},\"variables\":{\"getaway_prefs\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"demand\":\"getaway_prefs\",\"open\":true,\"evidence_semantics\":\"personal_history_summary\",\"scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"}}},\"requested_slots\":[\"getaway_prefs\"],\"requested_scopes\":{\"getaway_prefs\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"}},\"output_contract\":{\"mode\":\"semantic\",\"result_type\":\"text\",\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\",\"explanation\":\"semantic\"},\"program_revision\":0,\"rule_binding\":null,\"supported_parents\":{},\"known_observations\":[{\"id\":\"fact_190acf65ebeadb63e94402cb\",\"stance\":\"support\",\"value\":\"The user has a strong preference for creatively fulfilling weekend getaways that involve hands-on, practical engagement with music production and audio engineering. They have pursued activities such as attending a hands-on workshop on integrating traditional sounds with digital techniques, enrolling in an audio production workshop focused on mixing and mastering, and launching a podcast discussing the fusion of traditional and electronic music. They value deep engagement with the artistic process, personal creation over passive consumption, and activities that allow them to express their artistic vision and connect with others who share similar interests. They have also expressed a need to focus on what truly inspires them and aligns with their core values, avoiding activities that do not spark joy or interest.\",\"source_ids\":[\"s64\",\"s52\",\"s90\",\"s61\",\"s7\",\"s88\",\"s4\",\"s5\",\"s36\",\"s53\",\"s89\",\"s63\",\"s35\",\"s51\",\"s54\",\"s3\",\"s62\",\"s6\"],\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\",\"parent_versions\":{},\"retract_ids\":[],\"reason\":\"The user's statements across multiple conversations consistently express a preference for creative, hands-on musical activities. They announced a hiatus from remixing to focus on original compositions (s3-s7), expressed dissatisfaction with passive consumption of music documentaries and a desire for personal creation (s35-s36), launched a podcast on traditional/electronic fusion (s51-s54), enrolled in an audio production workshop after a hands-on workshop (s61-s64), and emphasized focusing on authentic, fulfilling interests (s88-s90). These collectively support a preference for creatively fulfilling weekend getaways involving music production, workshops, and deep engagement with the artistic process.\",\"variable\":\"getaway_prefs\",\"revoked\":[],\"semantic_status\":\"model_judgment\"}],\"source_spans\":[[\"s3\",\"d1\",107,413,\"User: I announced a hiatus from remixing to concentrate on original compositions and personal projects because I felt the remixes were overshadowing my own work. This decision was not made lightly, as I enjoyed the creative process of remixing and the way it allowed me to experiment with existing pieces. \",\"user\",[128,129]],[\"s4\",\"d1\",413,797,\"However, as I delved deeper into my own musical identity, I realized that I need to carve out space for my voice to shine through in original compositions. Taking this time off is about redefining my artistic vision and ensuring that my personal projects receive the attention they deserve. Ultimately, I hope to return with fresh ideas and a clearer focus on who I am as an artist.\\n\\n\",\"user\",[128,129]],[\"s5\",\"d1\",797,1102,\"User: I'm committing to invest my time in the creation of original music, focusing on my unique sound rather than merely reinterpreting the pieces of other artists. This decision comes from a deep-rooted desire to express my thoughts and feelings in ways that truly resonate with my personal experiences. \",\"user\",[128,129]],[\"s6\",\"d1\",1102,1392,\"I've come to understand that original compositions allow for a more authentic exploration of my artistic vision. It's an exciting challenge for me, as I embark on this journey of self-discovery through sound and melody, ultimately aiming for a sense of fulfillment in my creative pursuits. \",\"user\",[128,129]],[\"s7\",\"d1\",1392,1515,\"I hope to not only develop my skills but also share my passion with the world in a way that reflects who I am as an artist.\",\"user\",[128,129]],[\"s35\",\"d2\",105,478,\"User: I left feeling unsatisfied, as though the film skimmed over the intricacies that make music a universal language. It was almost as if they focused too much on celebrity interviews and not enough on the artistic process itself. I found myself reflecting on how music has the power to unite diverse cultures and express emotions that words alone often fail to capture. \",\"user\",[43]],[\"s36\",\"d2\",478,845,\"The disappointment lingered as I thought about the many documentaries that delve into the creative journeys of musicians, revealing not just their triumphs but also their struggles and failures. It made me realize that true connection with music often comes from a deeper engagement, one that can be achieved through personal creation rather than passive consumption.\",\"user\",[43]],[\"s51\",\"d3\",105,447,\"User: Yes! I launched a podcast discussing the fusion of traditional and electronic music. This platform has allowed me to reach a wider audience and share my experiences authentically. By interviewing artists and enthusiasts, I can dive deep into their creative processes and discover how they incorporate various elements into their music. \",\"user\",[58,59]],[\"s52\",\"d3\",447,817,\"The feedback I’ve received has been overwhelmingly positive, with listeners appreciating the insights and stories shared. I also love being able to explore not just the music itself, but the cultural contexts that shape these genres and influence artists worldwide.\\n\\nUser: I realized that sharing my experiences could inspire others and even reignite my own creativity. \",\"user\",[58,59]],[\"s53\",\"d3\",817,1128,\"The process of putting my thoughts into words has helped clarify my own perspective. It’s surprising how reflecting on past experiences can lead to deeper insights about one’s journey. Additionally, I’ve noticed that when I articulate my thoughts, it motivates me to think critically about my creative process. \",\"user\",[58,59]],[\"s54\",\"d3\",1128,1266,\"This paradigm shift has not only invigorated my passion for music but also allowed me to connect with others who share similar sentiments.\",\"user\",[58,59]],[\"s61\",\"d4\",105,388,\"User: Absolutely! After attending a hands-on workshop focused on integrating traditional sounds with digital techniques, I’m now enrolled in an audio production workshop. The workshop was eye-opening, providing insights into how to use technology to enhance traditional music forms. \",\"user\",[70,71]],[\"s62\",\"d4\",388,780,\"I’m excited about the audio production course because it promises to deepen my technical knowledge and skills, especially in mixing and mastering. This new set of skills will allow me to bring my creative vision to life in ways I never thought possible. I truly believe that this journey will not only elevate my music but also connect me more deeply with the traditions I'm learning about.\\n\\n\",\"user\",[70,71]],[\"s63\",\"d4\",780,1127,\"User: I found the practical aspects very exciting and relevant to my projects. Engaging in hands-on activities allows me to not only enhance my skills but also gain the confidence to experiment with different methods. It's invigorating to immerse myself in a learning environment where I can translate my imaginative ideas into tangible outcomes. \",\"user\",[70,71]],[\"s64\",\"d4\",1127,1386,\"This experience feels entirely different from the theoretical coursework, as it truly brings the subject to life. I believe this grounding in practical techniques will significantly impact my overall creative journey and foster a deeper connection to my work.\",\"user\",[70,71]],[\"s88\",\"d5\",107,341,\"User: It’s become clear to me that I need to focus on what truly inspires me and aligns more with my interests, especially recognizing how vital it is to engage with topics and activities that evoke a sense of passion and enthusiasm. \",\"user\",[107]],[\"s89\",\"d5\",341,694,\"I have realized that my time and energy are precious commodities, and they should be spent on pursuits that not only enrich my knowledge but also bring me a profound sense of fulfillment. Diving deeper into interests that resonate with my core values feels necessary, rather than stretching myself thin over activities that don't spark joy or interest. \",\"user\",[107]],[\"s90\",\"d5\",694,951,\"This realization is quite liberating, as I can see a path ahead that is clearer and more authentic to who I truly am. It makes me think about how we all deserve to chase our passions instead of conforming to what society or external pressures might dictate.\",\"user\",[107]],[\"s92\",\"d5\",964,1189,\"Assistant: It's truly commendable that you've taken this step back to reassess your priorities and focus on your authentic interests, as this kind of self-reflection is often the catalyst for meaningful change in one's life. \",\"assistant\",[108]],[\"s91\",\"d5\",951,964,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s93\",\"d5\",1189,1550,\"When you align your pursuits with what inspires you, not only are you more likely to excel, but you also cultivate a sense of joy and enthusiasm that can be contagious to those around you. It’s fascinating to note how our passions can evolve over time, and sometimes what initially drew us in might not be the same as we uncover deeper layers of our interests. \",\"assistant\",[108]],[\"s94\",\"d5\",1550,1754,\"In choosing to prioritize personal inspiration, you're setting a precedent for a fulfilling journey that could lead to immense personal growth, satisfaction, and a greater connection with your true self. \",\"assistant\",[108]],[\"s95\",\"d5\",1754,2018,\"Take pride in this decision you’re making, as it reflects a deeper understanding of what you truly want out of your experiences and aspirations, and ultimately, such clarity can pave the way for incredible opportunities in both your personal and professional life.\",\"assistant\",[108]],[\"s96\",\"d6\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 40–42 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s97\",\"d6\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s98\",\"d6\",105,430,\"User: I explored audio production techniques, but it just didn’t resonate with me, and I found myself tangled in technical details rather than embracing the creativity. I realized that while understanding the mechanics of sound is important, my true passion seems to lie more in experiencing music rather than dissecting it. \",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s99\",\"d6\",430,749,\"Despite my attempts to immerse myself in the production process, I came to feel it was more of a chore and less of the rewarding experience I had initially anticipated. I think I am more drawn to the emotional aspects of music, like the storytelling elements in lyrics or the feelings evoked by melodies and harmonies. \",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s100\",\"d6\",749,1006,\"Perhaps, I should focus my energy on areas that allow me to connect with music on a more emotional level.\\n\\nUser: It genuinely feels much better to focus on what truly inspires me, such as creating my own tracks, which bring me immense joy and satisfaction. \",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s101\",\"d6\",1006,1339,\"This process of creation allows me to express emotions and ideas that words sometimes fail to capture, acting as an outlet for my inner thoughts and feelings. Additionally, I find that crafting my own music provides me with a sense of accomplishment and personal growth, which is invaluable in a world often filled with uncertainty. \",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s102\",\"d6\",1339,1686,\"Music has a way of resonating with my soul, and every track I create becomes a piece of my identity and a reflection of my experiences. In contrast, when I watched a music documentary, it felt like something was missing, as it didn’t engage me in the way I had hoped, failing to evoke that same deep connection I feel when I compose my own pieces.\",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s103\",\"d6\",1686,1699,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s104\",\"d6\",1699,2074,\"Assistant: I completely understand where you're coming from, as focusing on your personal inspirations can lead to much more fulfilling creative experiences. When you channel your energy into producing music that resonates with you, it sets the stage for a more meaningful artistic journey, one where every note and beat are imbued with your unique perspective and emotions. \",\"assistant\",[42]],[\"s105\",\"d6\",2074,2413,\"The importance of self-expression through music cannot be overstated; it serves not only as a form of art but also as a therapeutic outlet. The reason documentaries can sometimes feel lacking is that they often offer an external perspective, stripping away the intimate connection that comes from creating something personally meaningful. \",\"assistant\",[42]],[\"s106\",\"d6\",2413,2670,\"While documentaries can provide insights and inspiration, they may not have the same emotional weight as hearing your own creations come to life, as they can't replicate the enriching experience of your own artistic journey and how it unfolds in real time. \",\"assistant\",[42]],[\"s107\",\"d6\",2670,2896,\"It's essential to honor that desire to create authentically, for it's in those moments of genuine expression that true artistry emerges, transforming mere sounds into something transcendent that can touch the hearts of others.\",\"assistant\",[42]],[\"s108\",\"d7\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 81–82 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s109\",\"d7\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s110\",\"d7\",105,344,\"User: It was a great way to blend my love for the outdoors with my musical creativity. The sounds of nature really added depth to the track, creating a rich tapestry of auditory experiences that transported listeners to serene landscapes. \",\"user\",[81]],[\"s111\",\"d7\",344,695,\"Moments spent in the woods, by riversides, or during rainy afternoons provided the perfect backdrop for inspiration, as I captured the essence of what it feels like to be in those environments. Each recording not only served as an instrument but also as a reminder of the memories tied to those places, enriching the emotional resonance of the music. \",\"user\",[81]],[\"s112\",\"d7\",695,817,\"This blending of natural elements with melody has truly rejuvenated my passion for creating and sharing music with others.\",\"user\",[81]],[\"s113\",\"d7\",817,830,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s114\",\"d7\",830,1178,\"Assistant: That sounds beautiful! Nature can inspire such unique musical elements, providing textures and layers that are often hard to replicate with traditional instruments alone. It’s fascinating how something as simple as the rustling of leaves or the chirping of birds can evoke powerful emotions and influence the direction of a composition. \",\"assistant\",[82]],[\"s115\",\"d7\",1178,1415,\"Have you thought about collaborating with other musicians on this? Working with others who share your passion for blending genres can lead to remarkable synergies, where each artist’s strengths complement one another in unexpected ways. \",\"assistant\",[82]],[\"s116\",\"d7\",1415,1777,\"Collaborations can also introduce you to new techniques, sounds, and ideas that could elevate your projects even further, especially in a band setting where different styles can creatively clash and harmonize. Plus, sharing your musical journey with others can lead to a richer experience, as you exchange not just sounds but stories behind every note and beat. \",\"assistant\",[82]],[\"s117\",\"d7\",1777,1897,\"I would love to learn more about your experiences in these collaborations and how they impact your music-making process.\",\"assistant\",[82]],[\"s118\",\"d8\",0,101,\"Conversation message indices 114–115 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s119\",\"d8\",101,107,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s120\",\"d8\",107,356,\"User: After several disagreements over the artistic direction, I felt stifled, which really discouraged me from that collaborative process. It was as if the creative vision I had in mind was at odds with the direction my bandmates wanted to pursue. \",\"user\",[114]],[\"s121\",\"d8\",356,713,\"I remember those discussions often being emotionally charged, where opinions clashed and passion ran high, but ultimately, it was clear that I couldn't contribute to something that did not resonate with my artistic essence. Feeling restricted in that environment made me question not just my contributions, but also my abilities and instincts as an artist. \",\"user\",[114]],[\"s122\",\"d8\",713,896,\"This inner turmoil prompted a desire for more autonomy over my own creative endeavors, leading to a pivotal decision to explore my artistry in a more personal and independent setting.\",\"user\",[114]],[\"s123\",\"d8\",896,909,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s124\",\"d8\",909,1168,\"Assistant: That sounds tough. It’s important to feel aligned with your collaborators. A collaborative effort should ideally enhance your creativity rather than hinder it, allowing every member to shine in their unique ways and share in the collective vision. \",\"assistant\",[115]],[\"s125\",\"d8\",1168,1486,\"When disagreements escalate, it can create a rift that not only affects the project but can also take a toll on personal relationships, leading to frustration and disillusionment. I'm glad to hear that you’re taking proactive steps toward something that feels right for you. What have you been focusing on since then? \",\"assistant\",[115]],[\"s126\",\"d8\",1486,1680,\"Redirecting your energy into new creative pursuits can be incredibly liberating, allowing you to thrive as an artist in your own right and explore territories you've always wanted to delve into.\",\"assistant\",[115]],[\"s127\",\"d9\",0,101,\"Conversation message indices 175–176 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s128\",\"d9\",101,107,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s129\",\"d9\",107,406,\"User: I went on a hiking date recently but found it tiring and, quite frankly, not enjoyable at all. The trek was supposed to be a fun way to connect with someone special, surrounded by nature and fresh air. However, instead of feeling invigorated by the outdoors, I felt overwhelmed and exhausted. \",\"user\",[175]],[\"s130\",\"d9\",406,682,\"It's surprising how strenuous a hike can be, especially when you're trying to navigate both the terrain and the expectations of a date. Perhaps it was the elevation or the length that caught me off guard, but it really put a damper on what was meant to be a joyful experience.\",\"user\",[175]],[\"s131\",\"d9\",682,695,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s132\",\"d9\",695,1044,\"Assistant: Physical dates can be challenging, particularly when they involve outdoor activities that demand a certain level of physical fitness and stamina. It's definitely important to consider the various aspects that might influence your enjoyment, such as the location, your current physical health, and even the weather conditions on that day. \",\"assistant\",[176]],[\"s133\",\"d9\",1044,1380,\"If the setting is too strenuous, it can hinder what could have been a wonderful opportunity to get to know someone. What kind of setting do you think would suit you better? For example, maybe an active date indoors, such as a cooking class, could allow for more engaging conversation without the physical toll that hiking often brings. \",\"assistant\",[176]],[\"s134\",\"d9\",1380,1558,\"Alternatively, a leisurely stroll in a local park or a visit to a cozy cafe might provide a relaxed atmosphere for both of you to connect without the stress of difficult terrain.\",\"assistant\",[176]],[\"s135\",\"d10\",0,101,\"Conversation message indices 181–181 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s136\",\"d10\",101,107,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s137\",\"d10\",107,398,\"User: I guess I’m learning more about what I truly enjoy and the environments that suit me best. It feels like every experience I have solidifies my understanding of what makes me comfortable or anxious, and this isn’t just about body language workshops but applies to my life more broadly. \",\"user\",[181]],[\"s138\",\"d10\",398,715,\"Discovering the types of social settings in which I flourish versus those that drain me helps me make better choices about where to invest my energy. Each new activity, whether it excites me or overwhelms me, acts as a stepping stone toward self-discovery, pushing me to engage in a continuous journey of reflection. \",\"user\",[181]],[\"s139\",\"d10\",715,850,\"Even in scenarios that challenge me, I can glean valuable insights into how I want to evolve and what I truly value in my interactions.\",\"user\",[181]],[\"s140\",\"d11\",0,101,\"Conversation message indices 151–152 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s141\",\"d11\",101,107,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s142\",\"d11\",107,450,\"User: Recently, I visited a singles club that organized some fun activities that were not just engaging but also designed to bring together a variety of people in a casual and friendly atmosphere. The environment was vibrant, filled with laughter and excitement, as everyone seemed eager to participate in the activities lined up for the day. \",\"user\",[151]],[\"s143\",\"d11\",450,823,\"Not only did I enjoy myself, but I also met some interesting people there who had unique stories and perspectives. Engaging in conversation with them allowed me to see the world through different lenses, each individual offering a glimpse into their personal experiences. Overall, it was a refreshing experience that left me feeling invigorated and open to new friendships.\",\"user\",[151]],[\"s144\",\"d11\",823,836,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s145\",\"d11\",836,1164,\"Assistant: Meeting new people can really expand your social circle, and it sounds like that singles club provided a fantastic opportunity for connection! The variety of activities organized in such venues often helps break the ice and facilitates interesting discussions, which can be invaluable for making genuine connections. \",\"assistant\",[152]],[\"s146\",\"d11\",1164,1460,\"I'm curious about the specific activities you participated in, as they often range from icebreaker games to creative workshops – each offering its own set of interactions. Engaging in group activities can also foster a sense of camaraderie, allowing participants to bond over shared experiences. \",\"assistant\",[152]],[\"s147\",\"d11\",1460,1824,\"It would be wonderful to hear more about how those interactions unfolded, the types of people you met, and whether there were any memorable moments that stood out during your time there. Building a social network can take time, but events like these can truly spark friendships that might even last beyond the initial gathering, leading to exciting new adventures.\",\"assistant\",[152]],[\"s148\",\"d12\",0,101,\"Conversation message indices 105–106 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s149\",\"d12\",101,107,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s150\",\"d12\",107,396,\"User: However, I dropped out of the audio production course after the first week, feeling overwhelmed by the complexity of the material. It was a tough decision because I really wanted to dive deeper into that realm of knowledge but the sheer volume of information presented was daunting. \",\"user\",[105]],[\"s151\",\"d12\",396,649,\"I keep reflecting on whether I could have approached it differently or managed my time better throughout those early days in the course. There’s a part of me that fears missing out on valuable skills that are essential for pursuing my passion in music. \",\"user\",[105]],[\"s152\",\"d12\",649,816,\"I’ve been thinking about other ways to learn audio production that might feel less intense and more manageable, perhaps through self-study or online resources instead.\",\"user\",[105]],[\"s153\",\"d12\",816,829,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s154\",\"d12\",829,1041,\"Assistant: It's completely understandable to feel overwhelmed, especially in a field as intricate as audio production, where the technical aspects can sometimes feel like speaking an entirely different language. \",\"assistant\",[106]]],\"required_scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"},\"rules_completion_required\":false,\"supported_task_outputs\":{},\"personal_response_selection\":true,\"phase\":\"history_evidence\",\"summary_revision_contracts\":{\"getaway_prefs\":{\"previous_version\":1,\"eligible_route_ids\":[\"fact_190acf65ebeadb63e94402cb\"],\"required_source_ids\":[\"s64\",\"s52\",\"s90\",\"s61\",\"s7\",\"s88\",\"s4\",\"s5\",\"s36\",\"s53\",\"s89\",\"s63\",\"s35\",\"s51\",\"s54\",\"s3\",\"s62\",\"s6\"]}},\"source_documents\":{\"d1\":{\"doc_id\":\"personamem:memory:dec3472e053d202dcd3cd3a9ab730cba91ae9b38d5a120db5c35075af3276352\",\"time_metadata\":{\"observed_start\":128.0,\"observed_end\":130.0,\"event_start\":null,\"event_end\":null,\"validity\":\"unknown\",\"time_source\":\"message_index\"}},\"d2\":{\"doc_id\":\"personamem:memory:7b3d5b8ebc55d4f8463449dd3b6b3147d9d452c1784c214e3109